## Configuration Convention

Projects that use TOML app configuration follow this contract:

- tracked defaults: `config/app.defaults.toml`
- tracked template: `config/app.example.toml`
- untracked local overrides: `config/app.local.toml`

Runtime precedence:

1. `config/app.defaults.toml`
2. `config/app.local.toml` (or `APP_CONFIG_PATH` when set)
3. secret file (`APP_SECRETS_PATH` or OS user path)
4. environment secret overrides

Secret file default locations:

- Windows: `%APPDATA%/<app>/secrets.toml`
- Linux/macOS: `~/.config/<app>/secrets.toml`

Global optional env vars:

- `APP_CONFIG_PATH`
- `APP_SECRETS_PATH`

